  "descriptionEn": "Base 1, height 0.15. Illustrates thin-domain asymptotics: as the height h → 0, the eigenvalues are governed by a 1D Schrödinger operator with potential 1/h(x)² (Friedlander–Solomyak 2009; Freitas–Krejčiřík 2008).",
